1
00:00:00,000 --> 00:00:23,090
[ Watch on KissFlix.co ]

2
00:00:23,360 --> 00:00:30,120
♪ Even though my heart says I love you ♪

3
00:00:30,120 --> 00:00:35,800
♪ Why am I like this? ♪

4
00:00:35,800 --> 00:00:38,400
♪ I don't understand ♪

5
00:00:38,400 --> 00:00:43,920
♪ What's wrong with my mouth and my heart? ♪

6
00:00:43,920 --> 00:00:48,720
♪ Why won't they say the same thing? ♪

7
00:00:49,080 --> 00:00:55,040
♪ Will we ever get to love each other? ♪

8
00:00:56,840 --> 00:00:58,560
You and Ms. Peem...

9
00:00:58,800 --> 00:01:01,640
You slept with her after knowing her for two days.

10
00:01:01,640 --> 00:01:03,720
His wife asked for her husband back in front of everyone.

11
00:01:03,720 --> 00:01:05,319
If you're not selling your body, what was that?

12
00:01:05,519 --> 00:01:07,160
You don't like that I'm an escort,

13
00:01:07,400 --> 00:01:09,440
but I also don't like that you look down on my job.

14
00:01:09,440 --> 00:01:12,240
A whore like you has no right to order me around.

15
00:01:12,240 --> 00:01:14,440
You're paying me millions to work for you

16
00:01:14,440 --> 00:01:16,000
because you want to control my life, don't you?

17
00:01:16,920 --> 00:01:18,840
Whatever you do, wherever you go, and whoever you go with,

18
00:01:18,920 --> 00:01:20,080
you must report to me.

19
00:01:20,160 --> 00:01:22,039
Because you belong to me. Do you understand?!

20
00:01:33,240 --> 00:01:34,600
Why don't you believe me?

21
00:01:35,240 --> 00:01:38,160
I told you there's really nothing between Mr. Techin and me.

22
00:01:39,479 --> 00:01:40,520
Mr. Techin.

23
00:01:42,120 --> 00:01:43,720
Sorry for calling you out of the blue.

24
00:01:44,520 --> 00:01:46,160
Is something wrong?

25
00:01:46,160 --> 00:01:47,720
I'd like to talk to you about a few things.

26
00:01:48,360 --> 00:01:50,600
About us, and about work.

27
00:01:55,320 --> 00:01:57,200
Have you made a deal with Ms. Peem yet?

28
00:02:04,680 --> 00:02:06,840
Then how about this? If you work for Ms. Peem

29
00:02:07,640 --> 00:02:09,199
and also work for me,

30
00:02:09,880 --> 00:02:11,200
how much would I have to pay you?

31
00:02:13,320 --> 00:02:15,120
What do you want me to do?

32
00:02:16,320 --> 00:02:20,200
Just give me a little information about Ms. Peem's work.

33
00:02:24,720 --> 00:02:25,640
I can't.

34
00:02:26,720 --> 00:02:29,320
And I don't know anything about Ms. Peem's business anyway.

35
00:02:31,320 --> 00:02:33,200
You're really good with keeping your client's secrets.

36
00:02:55,200 --> 00:02:57,320
Can you stay still? I'm trying to sleep.

37
00:02:58,160 --> 00:02:59,920
Do you want to sleep when hugging me?

38
00:03:00,920 --> 00:03:02,120
It's role-play.

39
00:03:03,600 --> 00:03:04,760
What kind of role-play?

40
00:03:06,960 --> 00:03:08,360
Roleplaying like we're a couple.

41
00:03:18,960 --> 00:03:20,000
Excuse me.

42
00:03:26,160 --> 00:03:27,600
Didn't you quit?

43
00:03:27,880 --> 00:03:29,640
Now that you've quit, cut ties with those people.

44
00:03:32,040 --> 00:03:33,960
But I need a social life too.

45
00:03:37,000 --> 00:03:38,440
A social life with whores?

46
00:03:43,600 --> 00:03:45,320
Let me tell you something.

47
00:03:45,400 --> 00:03:47,400
I fucking hate whores like you.

48
00:04:37,200 --> 00:04:38,440
I'm heading home.

49
00:04:58,520 --> 00:04:59,920
Can I buy some cakes to take home?

50
00:05:02,280 --> 00:05:03,760
You don't have to buy any.

51
00:05:09,960 --> 00:05:11,080
I'll take all of these.

52
00:05:14,280 --> 00:05:17,000
You can't. I still have to deliver these to the shop.

53
00:05:17,840 --> 00:05:19,360
How many can my money buy?

54
00:05:24,240 --> 00:05:25,800
If you help me make them,

55
00:05:26,400 --> 00:05:28,320
you can take as many as you want.

56
00:06:33,840 --> 00:06:35,159
You have to come to work with me.

57
00:06:36,800 --> 00:06:37,800
What?

58
00:06:37,880 --> 00:06:39,840
Dress nicely and go meet me at the office.

59
00:06:41,920 --> 00:06:43,240
What do you want me to do?

60
00:06:45,120 --> 00:06:47,480
I have a company deal I need to close.

61
00:06:47,840 --> 00:06:49,800
I need to get them to sign the contract.

62
00:06:50,360 --> 00:06:52,560
This deal means a lot to you, doesn't it?

63
00:06:53,320 --> 00:06:54,240
Yes.

64
00:06:59,440 --> 00:07:01,560
Meet me at the building at 9 a.m. tomorrow.

65
00:07:01,640 --> 00:07:03,520
And if you manage to close the deal for me,

66
00:07:03,600 --> 00:07:05,840
I’ll give you another five million,

67
00:07:05,840 --> 00:07:08,520
and wipe out your family's five-million-baht debt.

68
00:07:14,040 --> 00:07:15,880
Ms. Peem, Ms. Parn is here.

69
00:07:30,200 --> 00:07:31,480
That's your desk.

70
00:07:37,120 --> 00:07:38,760
I have to work in this room?

71
00:07:39,120 --> 00:07:40,040
Yes.

72
00:07:48,920 --> 00:07:50,800
So I can keep an eye on you.

73
00:07:52,159 --> 00:07:53,159
And besides,

74
00:07:54,000 --> 00:07:56,200
you won't cause trouble for others.

75
00:07:58,720 --> 00:08:00,040
You need to read all of this.

76
00:08:03,040 --> 00:08:05,040
You need to know everything I know.

77
00:08:05,120 --> 00:08:07,720
Every number, every detail of every project.

78
00:08:07,720 --> 00:08:09,320
You need to memorize all of them.

79
00:08:12,360 --> 00:08:14,000
Ask me if you don't understand something.

80
00:08:14,720 --> 00:08:15,440
Okay.

81
00:08:31,240 --> 00:08:32,080
Oh.

82
00:08:33,760 --> 00:08:35,240
I was just coming to see you.

83
00:08:36,559 --> 00:08:38,760
Someone told me you brought her to work.

84
00:08:39,559 --> 00:08:41,080
If she's going to negotiate the deal for us,

85
00:08:41,159 --> 00:08:42,760
she needs to know our project's detail.

86
00:08:42,760 --> 00:08:46,360
Great. I'll tell Uncle that this deal is practically done.

87
00:08:47,120 --> 00:08:49,480
I'll hurry and set up a meeting with Mr. Songsak for you

88
00:08:49,560 --> 00:08:51,080
before Techin does. Okay?

89
00:09:06,360 --> 00:09:07,760
I'm ordering lunch.

90
00:09:20,800 --> 00:09:22,280
What would you like, Ms. Peem?

91
00:09:22,280 --> 00:09:23,680
Italian food.

92
00:09:23,760 --> 00:09:25,160
Ask her what she wants.

93
00:09:28,560 --> 00:09:30,160
What would you like, Ms. Parn?

94
00:09:30,960 --> 00:09:32,520
I'm not hungry yet.

95
00:09:32,520 --> 00:09:34,880
I'll just have pineapple yogurt drink.

96
00:09:49,240 --> 00:09:50,280
Please order.

97
00:09:51,000 --> 00:09:52,400
Then anything is fine.

98
00:10:11,200 --> 00:10:12,440
How long are you going to make me wait?

99
00:10:14,520 --> 00:10:15,880
You go ahead and eat.

100
00:10:24,760 --> 00:10:26,600
You'll get a stomachache if you don't eat on a schedule.

101
00:11:10,880 --> 00:11:12,200
A reward for good girl.

102
00:11:20,480 --> 00:11:21,960
Come eat with me.

103
00:11:30,000 --> 00:11:31,440
Role-play again, I guess.

104
00:12:06,840 --> 00:12:08,200
(Alarm set for 6:30 a.m.)

105
00:12:20,640 --> 00:12:22,360
Is it morning already?

106
00:12:26,840 --> 00:12:29,160
It's morning. I have to go to work.

107
00:12:35,880 --> 00:12:38,160
Hotel occupancy rate...

108
00:12:39,120 --> 00:12:42,320
High-spending tourists...

109
00:13:03,280 --> 00:13:04,320
Peem!

110
00:13:07,080 --> 00:13:08,840
I've got good news for you today.

111
00:13:09,480 --> 00:13:11,000
Did you get a meeting with Mr. Songsak?

112
00:13:11,080 --> 00:13:13,800
Yes. Tonight at eight. I'll send you the location.

113
00:13:18,520 --> 00:13:21,960
Good luck. Take the contract along with Angel.

114
00:13:21,960 --> 00:13:23,720
I already told Mr. Songsak.

115
00:13:55,640 --> 00:13:57,320
I've memorized everything.

116
00:13:58,000 --> 00:13:59,720
This project is a mixed-use development,

117
00:13:59,800 --> 00:14:02,600
with a luxury hotel and a retail complex.

118
00:14:04,080 --> 00:14:06,440
The main target is high-spending tourists,

119
00:14:06,440 --> 00:14:09,480
especially the Chinese and East Asian markets.

120
00:14:09,480 --> 00:14:11,640
The main revenue will come from hotel occupancy rate

121
00:14:11,720 --> 00:14:13,800
and rental yields from the leased spaces.

122
00:14:13,880 --> 00:14:17,480
With a return on investment of 15-18% within three years.

123
00:14:17,480 --> 00:14:20,520
The project's main selling points are its location and branding.

124
00:14:20,520 --> 00:14:22,760
If we turn it into a destination,

125
00:14:22,840 --> 00:14:25,600
it won't just be a property. It'll be a landmark.

126
00:14:28,440 --> 00:14:29,360
Good.

127
00:14:31,920 --> 00:14:33,360
You can go home early today.

128
00:14:34,760 --> 00:14:38,120
I memorized everything. I don't have to work anymore?

129
00:14:38,640 --> 00:14:39,680
No.

130
00:14:40,440 --> 00:14:41,880
I'm sending you home to get ready.

131
00:14:42,360 --> 00:14:44,200
I'll pick you up at seven tonight.

132
00:14:44,960 --> 00:14:45,920
Where are we going?

133
00:14:49,880 --> 00:14:52,240
I have a meeting with Mr. Songsak about the contract tonight.

134
00:16:01,840 --> 00:16:04,560
(Outfit for tonight - Peem)

135
00:16:41,080 --> 00:16:42,280
Ms. Peem.

136
00:16:44,080 --> 00:16:45,120
Ms. Peem.

137
00:16:52,680 --> 00:16:54,040
I'm fine.

138
00:16:54,440 --> 00:16:55,720
Are you sure you're okay?

139
00:16:56,760 --> 00:16:57,600
Yeah.

140
00:17:02,320 --> 00:17:03,560
What do you think?

141
00:17:04,480 --> 00:17:05,319
About what?

142
00:17:05,319 --> 00:17:06,480
Am I pretty?

143
00:17:07,119 --> 00:17:08,160
You look fine.

144
00:17:08,800 --> 00:17:10,319
So you don't like it.

145
00:17:11,079 --> 00:17:12,520
It's decent.

146
00:17:51,360 --> 00:17:52,840
Now you look a little more expensive.

147
00:18:03,240 --> 00:18:04,200
You look pretty now.

148
00:18:36,640 --> 00:18:37,640
Have a seat.

149
00:18:56,120 --> 00:18:57,360
Thank you for meeting with us.

150
00:18:58,080 --> 00:19:02,720
Paradise Club's Angel is even prettier than what they say.

151
00:19:07,160 --> 00:19:08,680
Let's get straight to business.

152
00:19:11,280 --> 00:19:12,840
How's the project going?

153
00:19:13,480 --> 00:19:15,400
Why do you want me to invest?

154
00:19:21,040 --> 00:19:22,960
This is a mixed-use development.

155
00:19:23,040 --> 00:19:25,480
It consists of a luxury hotel and a retail complex.

156
00:19:28,040 --> 00:19:29,560
I'll sign the contract.

157
00:19:31,240 --> 00:19:33,960
I'll invest with Traisuvetthiwat.

158
00:19:39,040 --> 00:19:40,680
Did you bring the contract with you?

159
00:19:50,320 --> 00:19:51,280
Cheers!

160
00:19:58,920 --> 00:19:59,880
Parn.

161
00:20:11,800 --> 00:20:12,720
Cheers!

162
00:20:22,200 --> 00:20:23,440
As for the contract,

163
00:20:23,920 --> 00:20:26,800
I'll take care of it tomorrow and send it back to you.

164
00:20:27,440 --> 00:20:30,360
You know what I want now, right?

165
00:20:39,000 --> 00:20:41,040
But I don't want to force you.

166
00:21:06,840 --> 00:21:08,920
(Bank transfer received: 5,000,000 baht)

167
00:21:15,760 --> 00:21:16,960
Well?

168
00:21:33,560 --> 00:21:34,600
All right.

169
00:21:45,320 --> 00:21:47,080
I just never...

170
00:22:32,720 --> 00:22:34,280
It's just her job.

171
00:22:35,160 --> 00:22:37,120
She's done this who knows how many times.

172
00:23:53,960 --> 00:23:55,640
What else is there, Ms. Peem?

173
00:23:57,040 --> 00:23:58,120
The contract.

174
00:23:58,480 --> 00:24:01,640
What? Afraid I won't keep my word?

175
00:24:42,800 --> 00:24:44,880
Are you choosing this billion-baht contract...

176
00:24:46,320 --> 00:24:47,560
or Parn?

177
00:24:54,280 --> 00:24:55,560
I want my woman back.

178
00:25:50,440 --> 00:25:52,000
Where did he touch you?

179
00:26:01,160 --> 00:26:02,360
Did he touch you here?

180
00:26:28,920 --> 00:26:31,120
Here. Did he touch you?

181
00:26:49,400 --> 00:26:50,640
What about here?

182
00:27:30,280 --> 00:27:32,160
I'll wash it all away.

183
00:27:32,240 --> 00:27:34,120
And I won't let anyone touch you again.

184
00:28:21,520 --> 00:28:22,440
You...

185
00:28:25,320 --> 00:28:26,640
Call me Peem.

186
00:28:45,000 --> 00:28:46,040
Peem.

187
00:29:39,240 --> 00:29:40,520
What are you staring at?

188
00:29:41,520 --> 00:29:42,480
Nothing.

189
00:29:43,920 --> 00:29:45,200
Come eat.

190
00:29:52,000 --> 00:29:59,000
♪ Even though my heart says I love you ♪

191
00:29:59,080 --> 00:30:04,320
♪ Why am I like this? ♪

192
00:30:04,400 --> 00:30:06,960
♪ I don't understand ♪

193
00:30:07,040 --> 00:30:12,480
♪ What's wrong with my mouth and my heart? ♪

194
00:30:12,560 --> 00:30:17,360
♪ Why won't they say the same thing? ♪

195
00:30:17,720 --> 00:30:24,600
♪ Will we ever get to love each other? ♪

196
00:30:28,840 --> 00:30:32,200
♪ It's just one word: "love" ♪

197
00:30:32,280 --> 00:30:37,440
♪ Why can't I bring myself to say it? I don't understand ♪

198
00:30:38,240 --> 00:30:41,480
♪ Why do I keep it inside? ♪

199
00:30:41,560 --> 00:30:45,000
♪ All I can do is angry at myself ♪

200
00:30:45,080 --> 00:30:48,440
♪ For pretending to be cold ♪

201
00:30:48,520 --> 00:30:53,640
♪ Making something so simple so much harder than it has to be ♪

202
00:30:54,600 --> 00:30:55,880
Eat a lot.

203
00:31:17,480 --> 00:31:18,880
Why haven't you gotten dressed yet?

204
00:31:22,200 --> 00:31:23,880
I was waiting to talk to you first.

205
00:31:24,120 --> 00:31:25,080
About what?

206
00:31:26,040 --> 00:31:27,400
About last night.

207
00:31:28,240 --> 00:31:29,800
I need to return your money.

208
00:31:29,800 --> 00:31:30,920
You don't have to.

209
00:31:32,160 --> 00:31:33,960
But I couldn't close the deal for you.

210
00:31:34,160 --> 00:31:37,320
Anything I give you, I don't take back.

211
00:31:37,320 --> 00:31:39,400
- But I-- - Consider it payment then.

212
00:31:45,120 --> 00:31:47,520
Does that mean you'll continue to hire me?

213
00:31:49,360 --> 00:31:50,240
Yeah.

214
00:31:51,120 --> 00:31:54,600
Then... what do you want me to do this time?

215
00:32:01,480 --> 00:32:03,400
Just stay by my side.

216
00:32:13,960 --> 00:32:15,240
Stop staring at me.

217
00:32:15,240 --> 00:32:17,640
Get dressed. I'm taking you to get your things.

218
00:32:17,640 --> 00:32:19,200
What things?

219
00:32:22,080 --> 00:32:23,200
Your clothes.

220
00:32:24,120 --> 00:32:25,960
You're moving in with me.

221
00:32:29,400 --> 00:32:30,320
Why?

222
00:32:31,280 --> 00:32:34,400
Being still like this... Do you want me to dress you?

223
00:32:35,400 --> 00:32:36,320
No.

224
00:32:42,720 --> 00:32:44,360
Hurry up. I hate waiting for a long time.

225
00:33:02,400 --> 00:33:03,560
Are these all the clothes you have?

226
00:33:04,200 --> 00:33:05,040
Yes.

227
00:33:05,880 --> 00:33:08,080
You've got a lot of clients. What do you do with the money?

228
00:33:09,160 --> 00:33:10,960
I have other expenses to take care of.

229
00:33:12,080 --> 00:33:13,760
You have plenty of clients from Paradise Club.

230
00:33:15,720 --> 00:33:17,400
Or do you go to host bars?

231
00:33:17,480 --> 00:33:19,440
Spend all your money for the guys there?

232
00:33:20,760 --> 00:33:23,880
I hear women in your line of work have to please men

233
00:33:23,880 --> 00:33:25,560
and want to be pampered too.

234
00:33:25,640 --> 00:33:28,680
So you spend your money on host boys to be pampered?

235
00:33:30,800 --> 00:33:32,160
That's not me.

236
00:33:32,240 --> 00:33:33,800
Then where does all your money go?

237
00:33:54,680 --> 00:33:55,880
Where's your car?

238
00:33:55,960 --> 00:33:58,240
I'll have the driver take it to the condo.

239
00:33:58,320 --> 00:33:59,240
I don't have one.

240
00:34:00,200 --> 00:34:01,880
My car broke down, so it's being repaired.

241
00:34:02,400 --> 00:34:03,680
Then how do you get to work?

242
00:34:04,240 --> 00:34:05,240
Taxi.

243
00:34:05,720 --> 00:34:08,000
I don't get it. You make hundreds of thousands a day.

244
00:34:08,080 --> 00:34:09,480
You should have used it for something.

245
00:34:09,760 --> 00:34:11,560
No car, and your place is tiny.

246
00:34:12,000 --> 00:34:14,480
What do you spend your money on? Gambling?

247
00:34:15,840 --> 00:34:17,040
No.

248
00:34:18,960 --> 00:34:21,159
Your family, right? The debt?

249
00:34:22,280 --> 00:34:23,719
Do they spend a lot of money?

250
00:34:24,719 --> 00:34:27,199
Yes. I have no choice but to help.

251
00:34:28,880 --> 00:34:30,320
You do have a choice.

252
00:34:30,840 --> 00:34:32,840
Maybe you have choices,

253
00:34:33,520 --> 00:34:37,000
but I don't get to choose what I want or don't want to do.

254
00:34:37,719 --> 00:34:40,400
For me, making money is about survival.

255
00:34:40,960 --> 00:34:43,239
Some days I make money. Some days I don't.

256
00:34:43,719 --> 00:34:45,800
But the bills don't disappear.

257
00:34:46,639 --> 00:34:48,080
You probably wouldn't understand.

258
00:34:48,080 --> 00:34:50,159
You were born with everything.

259
00:34:50,159 --> 00:34:53,480
But I have to struggle for everything myself.

260
00:35:06,920 --> 00:35:10,120
Woah. Why are there so many bags here?

261
00:35:12,800 --> 00:35:15,600
Your clothes. I had them brought to here.

262
00:35:28,240 --> 00:35:29,800
Why did you buy all this?

263
00:35:29,880 --> 00:35:31,320
It's a lot.

264
00:35:32,480 --> 00:35:34,000
You're going to work with me.

265
00:35:34,680 --> 00:35:36,640
I don't think the four outfits I gave you are enough.

266
00:35:38,080 --> 00:35:41,440
Even if I wore these for a month, I probably couldn't wear them all.

267
00:35:42,440 --> 00:35:43,840
Better to have too much than too little.

268
00:35:49,880 --> 00:35:51,440
Where am I supposed to sleep?

269
00:35:53,320 --> 00:35:55,560
There's only one bedroom. Where else would you sleep?

270
00:35:58,760 --> 00:36:00,200
You'll sleep in there with me.

271
00:36:09,240 --> 00:36:11,040
Don't act like we've never slept together.

272
00:36:12,720 --> 00:36:14,080
Before this,

273
00:36:15,640 --> 00:36:17,440
you did more than just sleep.

274
00:36:20,600 --> 00:36:22,680
Or do you want to try somewhere else?

275
00:36:23,440 --> 00:36:24,800
The kitchen.

276
00:36:25,760 --> 00:36:27,160
The dining table.

277
00:36:30,720 --> 00:36:32,520
Or if you want to go somewhere else,

278
00:36:34,280 --> 00:36:35,400
we can do it in the car.

279
00:37:12,800 --> 00:37:14,080
She's not answering.

280
00:37:26,920 --> 00:37:29,040
After causing all this trouble, she just disappears.

281
00:37:29,600 --> 00:37:30,920
That's not like Peem.

282
00:37:40,240 --> 00:37:41,520
You're not answering?

283
00:37:42,720 --> 00:37:44,760
Mr. Pat has called you so many times.

284
00:37:46,600 --> 00:37:48,080
I don't feel like talking to him.

285
00:37:48,320 --> 00:37:50,120
Maybe it's something important.

286
00:37:51,000 --> 00:37:53,480
If it's important, we can talk when we meet.

287
00:37:54,160 --> 00:37:55,600
I don't want to talk right now.

288
00:38:27,440 --> 00:38:29,160
Can you turn around for a second?

289
00:38:35,440 --> 00:38:36,800
Give Parn a hug.

290
00:38:54,320 --> 00:38:57,160
If you can't fix it today, you can fix it tomorrow.

291
00:38:59,200 --> 00:39:00,720
It'll pass.

292
00:39:15,800 --> 00:39:17,880
Do you do this with every client?

293
00:39:21,080 --> 00:39:22,160
No.

294
00:39:27,040 --> 00:39:28,600
You're the first.

295
00:39:43,480 --> 00:39:45,560
You're the first one I've done this for too.

296
00:40:01,040 --> 00:40:04,040
If you're happy with the deal, I'm happy for you.

297
00:40:09,200 --> 00:40:10,800
But I heard...

298
00:40:10,800 --> 00:40:14,160
you had a meeting with Ms. Phakanee before me, didn't you?

299
00:40:16,720 --> 00:40:18,400
That woman doesn't have a brain.

300
00:40:18,880 --> 00:40:20,200
So the deal fell through.

301
00:40:22,320 --> 00:40:24,560
Mr. Phakpoom won't be angry with me, will he?

302
00:40:25,400 --> 00:40:26,480
He won't.

303
00:40:28,040 --> 00:40:32,840
But he'll find out that the only daughter he groomed to take over the company

304
00:40:33,560 --> 00:40:34,600
is an idiot.

305
00:40:35,320 --> 00:40:37,080
She couldn't even figure out what to choose

306
00:40:37,160 --> 00:40:39,720
between a billion baht and a whore.

307
00:40:46,000 --> 00:40:48,360
When I'm stressed, I like coming here.

308
00:40:53,400 --> 00:40:54,960
Do you feel a little better?

309
00:41:00,760 --> 00:41:01,760
Yeah.

310
00:41:11,440 --> 00:41:12,280
Who is it?

311
00:41:14,360 --> 00:41:15,240
It's Sis Mol.

312
00:41:17,760 --> 00:41:19,320
Didn't I tell you to quit?

313
00:41:20,000 --> 00:41:21,640
Why does she keep bothering you?

314
00:41:21,720 --> 00:41:23,400
Doesn't she understand what "quit" means?

315
00:41:27,640 --> 00:41:29,320
I asked Miew to tell her.

316
00:41:29,320 --> 00:41:31,080
Then why didn't you tell her yourself?

317
00:41:31,080 --> 00:41:32,800
Do you still want to go back to work there?

318
00:41:35,520 --> 00:41:37,320
I don't have the courage to tell her myself.

319
00:42:06,840 --> 00:42:08,680
I owe her a lot.

320
00:42:09,600 --> 00:42:11,240
She gave me a job when I was just a kid.

321
00:42:12,640 --> 00:42:13,960
That was illegal, you know.

322
00:42:19,080 --> 00:42:20,720
She hired me as a dishwasher.

323
00:42:22,480 --> 00:42:24,960
I guess she couldn't stand seeing me cry.

324
00:42:26,120 --> 00:42:28,440
If she hadn't given me that job back then,

325
00:42:28,520 --> 00:42:30,080
I don't know what I would've done.

326
00:42:31,920 --> 00:42:35,080
Then how did you go from washing dishes to...

327
00:42:35,920 --> 00:42:38,480
Washing dishes only paid 300 baht a day.

328
00:42:38,560 --> 00:42:40,520
It wasn't enough for my family's expenses.

329
00:42:41,960 --> 00:42:44,280
I saw those girls making stacks of cash,

330
00:42:45,440 --> 00:42:47,240
getting expensive gifts from clients.

331
00:42:50,200 --> 00:42:51,880
I wanted that kind of money.

332
00:42:51,880 --> 00:42:53,960
So I asked Sis Mol to let me work out front.

333
00:42:55,680 --> 00:42:57,000
And she agreed?

334
00:42:58,600 --> 00:42:59,560
No.

335
00:43:01,000 --> 00:43:03,880
She said once you get into that line of work, it's hard to get out.

336
00:43:04,120 --> 00:43:05,880
I was still young. I had my whole future ahead of me.

337
00:43:05,960 --> 00:43:07,720
She told me to find something else to do.

338
00:43:08,920 --> 00:43:11,480
But no matter how hard I tried, it wasn't enough for my family.

339
00:43:14,120 --> 00:43:16,360
In the end, I have to work there anyway.

340
00:43:22,320 --> 00:43:24,160
If you want to talk to Sis Mol,

341
00:43:29,000 --> 00:43:30,400
I won't stop you.

342
00:44:40,200 --> 00:44:42,680
She doesn't, doesn't, doesn't answer!

343
00:44:48,880 --> 00:44:50,120
Mr. Pat.

344
00:44:51,200 --> 00:44:53,000
Are you going to see the chairman now?

345
00:44:55,360 --> 00:44:56,920
Does Uncle know yet?

346
00:44:57,000 --> 00:44:58,440
I've already informed the chairman's secretary

347
00:44:58,440 --> 00:45:01,000
that Mr. Songsak finalized the deal with Mr. Techin this morning.

348
00:45:01,000 --> 00:45:03,720
They're expecting to send out a PR announcement this afternoon.

349
00:45:11,640 --> 00:45:15,600
Let's see if she'll answer if Uncle calls her himself.

350
00:45:39,040 --> 00:45:40,080
Yes, Dad.

351
00:45:44,640 --> 00:45:46,440
I'll go to the office right away.

352
00:45:57,200 --> 00:46:00,200
Is this the woman? The whore you picked up from the bar?

353
00:46:00,200 --> 00:46:02,120
I don't care that she's a woman.

354
00:46:02,120 --> 00:46:04,440
Are you being stupid and getting fooled by a whore?

355
00:46:04,520 --> 00:46:05,480
Dad!

356
00:46:05,560 --> 00:46:07,400
I believe you can get through this.

357
00:46:07,400 --> 00:46:08,760
As long as you don't give up,

358
00:46:08,760 --> 00:46:10,600
you'll always find a way forward.

359
00:46:10,600 --> 00:46:14,000
Parn, will you stay by my side like this, always?

360
00:46:14,400 --> 00:46:16,120
Will Ms. Peem know

361
00:46:16,200 --> 00:46:18,160
you have to do something like this?

362
00:46:18,240 --> 00:46:20,240
But I won't touch Ms. Peem

363
00:46:20,720 --> 00:46:22,360
if you do as I say.

364
00:46:22,560 --> 00:46:23,440
Ms. Peem.

365
00:46:24,320 --> 00:46:25,120
Ms. Peem.

366
00:46:25,120 --> 00:46:31,800
♪ Even though my heart says I love you ♪

367
00:46:32,200 --> 00:46:37,440
♪ Why am I like this? ♪

368
00:46:37,440 --> 00:46:40,080
♪ I don't understand ♪

369
00:46:40,160 --> 00:46:45,400
♪ What's wrong with my mouth and my heart? ♪

370
00:46:45,680 --> 00:46:50,080
♪ Why won't they say the same thing? ♪
